# TCP transport capacity constants (Wave 1A-3): connection slot size and
# bind-retry attempt budgets previously hardcoded in ClientSlot.cs and MCPServer.cs.
# maxClients: max simultaneous client connections per port (ClientSlot.cs:51).
# mainBindMaxAttempts: bind retries for the main MCP listener (MCPServer.cs:352).
# chatBindMaxAttempts: bind retries for the chat listener (MCPServer.cs:410).
RECORD Transport COUNT 1
  maxClients: int
  mainBindMaxAttempts: int
  chatBindMaxAttempts: int
END
